    <div class="a_banner_title">
      <h1>品牌故事<span>OUR STORY</span></h1>
      <p>
      勞瑞斯牛肋排餐廳，1938年成立於美國比佛利山莊，提供五星級評價的頂級牛肋排桌邊現拌的冰旋翡翠沙拉為晚餐拉開序幕，穿著一身潔白的專業師傅，搭配紅色絲絨繫著閃耀的金牌領著價值百萬的銀色手工打造餐車至桌邊服務，提供最正統的低溫烘烤牛肋排這些元素都是打造勞瑞斯牛肋排餐廳80多年來的成功與不朽      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrapper">

          <section class="a_bg">
<div class="container-fluid">
<div class="row justify-content-center">
<div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-11">
<div class="a_box a_box1">
<p>西元1938年，勞倫斯‧法蘭克(Lawrence L. Frank) 和華特‧肯培(Walter Van de Kamp) 合作的第一家勞瑞斯牛肋排餐廳，在位於<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib/@34.067699,-118.3786501,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x80c2b94f25c7eb0f:0x83add879c8fe0c99!8m2!3d34.067699!4d-118.3760752!16s%2Fg%2F1v96m19q?entry=ttu">加州比佛利山莊</a>(Beverly Hills) 的拉辛尼倫吉大道上(La Cienega Boulevard) 正式開幕。對勞倫斯而言，開設牛肋排餐廳是實現他小時候長久以來的夢想，無非是希望大家和親朋好友相聚的同時，可以一起大啖牛肋排，分享生命中每一刻美好的時光。勞倫斯敏銳的直覺告訴了他，餐廳的格調要非常高雅，讓消費者覺得魅力十足，但在價格上要讓消費者覺得可以信賴、精緻卻又物超所值、不會有壓力。因此，勞倫斯對於盤飾和上桌的呈現手法特別重視；例如在餐桌旁現場切割牛肋排的銀色不鏽鋼餐車，就是個令消費者歎為觀止的創意，仿佛是把迷你廚房帶到餐桌旁來為消費者服務。<br /><br />勞瑞斯牛肋排餐廳目前除了加州比佛利山莊創始店之外，另有<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib/@36.1151116,-115.1620988,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x80c8c448b1ae27e9:0xac4ac6be3f45f92c!8m2!3d36.1151073!4d-115.1595239!16s%2Fg%2F1tnqh87q?entry=ttu">拉斯維加斯</a>分店。亞洲地區則有<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib+Singapore/@1.3018686,103.832127,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x31da199173a982cf:0x64dca853b27fe057!4m6!3m5!1s0x31da199220d20b9f:0xf9880657f2be22a5!8m2!3d1.3018632!4d103.8369979!16s%2Fg%2F1tl_j6w1?entry=ttu">新加坡</a>、台北、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry%E2%80%99s+The+Prime+Rib+%E8%B5%A4%E5%9D%82%E5%BA%97/@35.6699416,139.7400625,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x60188b8f77a2d699:0x917c7d276d610071!4m6!3m5!1s0x60188b8f7a4df4f9:0xf8422f275730646b!8m2!3d35.6699373!4d139.7426374!16s%2Fg%2F11d_23nsqk?entry=ttu">東京赤坂</a>、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib/@22.2802324,114.1536625,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x34040066bcd3a513:0xff40757504dec5e9!8m2!3d22.2802275!4d114.1585334!16s%2Fg%2F12vr50drt?entry=ttu">香港</a>、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawrys+The+Prime+Rib/@34.6995173,135.4914249,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x6000e68d2720c7c1:0x486cece455398279!4m6!3m5!1s0x6000e68cdb562ae1:0xb7b8ed9baa806192!8m2!3d34.6995129!4d135.4939998!16s%2Fg%2F11b7rttpwr?entry=ttu">大阪</a>、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib/@37.4978783,127.0234711,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x357ca15bd138859d:0x5341de171bd3949f!8m2!3d37.4978741!4d127.026046!16s%2Fg%2F1q5ccvdky?entry=ttu">首爾</a>、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib/@35.642203,137.0769462,7z/data=!3m1!5s0x60188b15c5b0a50f:0x1bcc6720d8a23b26!4m10!1m2!2m1!1zTGF3cnkncyBUaGUgUHJpbWUgUmliIOaDoOavlOWjvQ!3m6!1s0x60188b15d5d7e215:0xf718a97f1f94aef2!8m2!3d35.642203!4d139.713665!15sCh9MYXdyeSdzIFRoZSBQcmltZSBSaWIg5oOg5q-U5aO9WiMiIWxhd3J5J3MgdGhlIHByaW1lIHJpYiDmg6Ag5q-UIOWjvZIBE2FtZXJpY2FuX3Jlc3RhdXJhbnSaASNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUktka3d0TkZkbkVBReABAA!16s%2Fg%2F1xg5snnx?entry=ttu">東京惠比壽</a>、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/LAWRY'S/@31.2204966,121.4720541,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x35b27071f3951023:0xbe652bb291a17704!8m2!3d31.220492!4d121.474629!16s%2Fg%2F1tks4b6y?entry=ttu">上海</a>、<a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/Lawry's+The+Prime+Rib,+Jakarta/@-6.238509,106.7872082,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x2e69f1605b3915f9:0xc1a9e6eed24c5d5b!8m2!3d-6.2385143!4d106.7897831!16s%2Fg%2F11vhzg5s_c?entry=ttu">雅加達</a>分店。每家分店都同樣提供著最經典的英式烘烤牛肋排及各式美味餐點，在亞太地區始終深獲消費者的喜愛。</p>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
